  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This polygon shapefile depicts landmark features for the County of San Mateo and includes features such as civic buildings, hospitals, event venues, recreation centers, beaches, schools, libraries, parks and airports. This layer is part of a collection of GIS data for San Mateo County, California.",
    "This coverage can be used for basic applications such as viewing, querying, and map output production, or to provide a basemap to support graphical overlays and analyses of geospatial data."
